---
title: Discover Indie Browser Games & AI Experiments
description: Find indie browser games, game-jam surprises and AI experiments. Explore the directory and play at the original source.
permalink: /
---
{# Homepage — editorial directory style.
   Hero (merged with page, no colliding gradient panel) → asymmetric Editor's
   Picks → Browse by Category (list rows) → New Arrivals (horizontal rail) →
   About (prose column). Preserves all URLs, categories, JSON-LD, business
   positioning. Static pre-rendered, no JS-rendered rails. #}

{% extends 'base.njk' %}

{% set featured_games = games | featuredOnly | limit(8) %}
{% set new_games = games | sortByDateDesc | limit(12) %}
{% set total_games = games | length %}

{% block jsonld %}
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@graph": [
    {
      "@type": "WebSite",
      "name": "ArcadeBloom",
      "description": "{{ site.description }}",
      "url": "{{ site.url }}/",
      "publisher": { "@id": "{{ site.url }}/#org" },
      "potentialAction": {
        "@type": "SearchAction",
        "target": {
          "@type": "EntryPoint",
          "urlTemplate": "{{ site.url }}/search/?q={search_term_string}"
        },
        "query-input": "required name=search_term_string"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Organization",
      "@id": "{{ site.url }}/#org",
      "name": "ArcadeBloom",
      "url": "{{ site.url }}/",
      "description": "A directory of indie browser games and AI experiments.",
      "logo": "{{ site.url }}/og-image.png"
    }
  ]
}
</script>
{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
<section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pt-12 pb-8 md:pt-20 md:pb-12">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-3 gap-10 items-end">
        <div class="lg:col-span-2 max-w-3xl">
            <h1 class="display-h1 text-5xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl">Find your next<br>small obsession.</h1>
            <p class="mt-6 text-lg md:text-xl text-paper-70 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">Indie browser games, game-jam surprises and experiments you might never stumble across. Pick something interesting. Play at the source.</p>
            <div class="mt-8 max-w-xl">
                {% set size = 'lg' %}{% include 'search-inline.njk' %}
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 mt-5">
                <a href="/featured/" class="btn-ghost">Explore the picks</a>
                <a href="/new/" class="btn-ghost">See what's new</a>
            </div>
        </div>
        <aside class="surface-raised rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8">
            <h2 class="display-h2 text-3xl">A different kind of play.</h2>
            <p class="text-paper-70 leading-relaxed mt-4">An AI storyteller. A word-game referee. A creator trying a new tool. Meet the games exploring AI.</p>
            <a href="/ai-games/" class="btn-ghost mt-6">Explore AI games</a>
        </aside>
    </div>
</section>

{# =====================================================================
   EDITOR'S PICKS — asymmetric layout, not a uniform grid.
   1 large feature (first pick) + a row of smaller satellites.
   Signals editorial curation rather than a product catalog.
   ===================================================================== #}
{% set picks = featured_games | sortByScreenshotThenDate | limit(7) %}
{% if picks.length %}
<section id="picks" class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 md:py-14">
    {% set heading_eyebrow = "Editor's picks" %}
    {% set heading_title = "Jump straight in" %}
    {% set heading_subtitle = "Small projects with an idea worth exploring. Meet the game, then jump to its original site." %}
    {% set heading_href = "/featured/" %}
    {% set heading_link_label = "All featured" %}
    {% include 'section-heading.njk' %}
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-4 md:gap-6">
        {# Hero feature — first pick, spans tall on large screens #}
        {% if picks.length > 0 %}
        {% set game = picks[0] %}
        {% set lazy = false %}
        <div class="lg:row-span-2">
            {% include 'game-card-feature.njk' %}
        </div>
        {% endif %}

        {# Satellites — the rest, in a responsive sub-grid #}
        {% set satellites = picks | slice(1, 6) %}
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 md:gap-6 lg:grid-cols-3">
            {% for game in satellites %}
            {% include 'game-card.njk' %}
            {% endfor %}
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-6 sm:hidden">
        <a href="/featured/" class="btn-ghost w-full">All featured picks →</a>
    </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

{% set ai_games = games | aiGames | sortByDateDesc | limit(4) %}
{% if ai_games.length %}
<section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 md:py-14">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-4 mb-6">
        <div><h2 class="display-h2 text-3xl md:text-4xl">AI in the playground</h2><p class="text-paper-70 mt-3">New mechanics, open-ended stories and tools behind the scenes.</p></div>
        <a href="/ai-games/" class="link-inline">Explore AI games</a>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
        {% for game in ai_games %}{% include 'game-card.njk' %}{% endfor %}
    </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

{# Sponsored slot — contained visually (label + hairline) so it reads as
   intentional rather than a broken widget. #}
<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    {% include 'ad-banner.njk' %}
</div>

{# =====================================================================
   BROWSE BY CATEGORY — editorial list rows, not cards.
   Each row carries its category accent on hover.
   ===================================================================== #}
<section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 md:py-20">
    {% set heading_eyebrow = 'The catalogue' %}
    {% set heading_title = 'Browse by Category' %}
    {% set heading_subtitle = 'Follow a familiar genre into something unexpected.' %}
    {% set heading_href = '' %}
    {% include 'section-heading.njk' %}
    <div class="border-b border-[var(--hairline)]">
        {% for cat in site.categories %}
        {% set cat_count = games | whereEq('category', cat.slug) | length %}
        {% set is_thin = cat_count < site.minGamesPerCategory %}
        {% set count = cat_count %}
        {% set min = site.minGamesPerCategory %}
        {% include 'category-row.njk' %}
        {% endfor %}
    </div>
</section>

{# =====================================================================
   NEW ARRIVALS — horizontal scroll rail.
   Differentiated from Editor's Picks: peek/scroll says "fresh, keep moving".
   ===================================================================== #}
{% if new_games.length %}
<section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 md:py-14">
    {% set heading_eyebrow = 'Fresh in' %}
    {% set heading_title = 'New arrivals' %}
    {% set heading_subtitle = 'The most recent additions to the directory.' %}
    {% set heading_href = '/new/' %}
    {% set heading_link_label = 'All new arrivals' %}
    {% include 'section-heading.njk' %}
    {# The rail is one row of cards; on small screens each card is ~70vw,
       on md+ a fixed 260px. Snap scrolling keeps it tidy. #}
    <div class="rail -mx-4 px-4 sm:mx-0 sm:px-0">
        {% for game in new_games %}
        <div class="w-[70vw] sm:w-[260px]">
            {% include 'game-card.njk' %}
        </div>
        {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <div class="mt-5">
        <a href="/new/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-semibold text-bloom hover:text-paper transition-colors">
            See all new arrivals <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>
    </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

<section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 md:py-16">
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 surface-raised rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-10">
        <div>
            <h2 class="display-h2 text-3xl md:text-4xl">Small games deserve to be found.</h2>
            <p class="text-paper-70 leading-relaxed mt-5 max-w-xl">Made for a jam, built after work, or dreamed up by a tiny studio. We bring scattered browser games together, with a short introduction and a direct link to the people who made them.</p>
            <a href="/about/" class="link-inline inline-block mt-5">About ArcadeBloom</a>
        </div>
        <div class="md:pl-6">
            <h2 class="display-h2 text-2xl">Have a game to share?</h2>
            <p class="text-paper-70 leading-relaxed mt-4">Your own project or an unexpected find. Send us the official link and tell us what caught your attention.</p>
            <a href="/submit/" class="btn-ghost mt-6">Submit a game</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
{% endblock %}
